 .gitignore           |   1 -
 priv_wrapper.keyring | Bin 0 -> 20849 bytes
 priv_wrapper.spec    |   6 ++++++
 sources              |   1 -
 4 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 priv_wrapper.keyring

